#: includes/help-page.php:72
msgid "New uploads"
msgstr ""

#: includes/help-page.php:73
msgid "Drop a .heic photo into the Media Library, the block editor, Elementor or Media → Add New. It is converted to JPG or PNG before it is uploaded."
msgstr ""

#: includes/help-page.php:76
msgid "Existing images"
msgstr ""

#: includes/help-page.php:77
msgid "HEIC images already in the Media Library are listed under Tools. Convert them all at once, or let them convert in the background while you work in the dashboard."
